### 1. Create a user → expect 201
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@test.com",
  "password": "Secret123!",
  "firstname": "Alice",
  "lastname": "Martin"
}

### 2. List users → expect 200 + a list
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users

### 3. Get one user → expect 200
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users/1

### 4. Invalid email → expect 422
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "x"
}
